{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026B9LxOxNbEk1792680972.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國新申領失業金人數見三個月最少。</p><p></p><p>美國勞工部公布，首次申領失業保險救濟人數上星期減少6,000人，至19.4萬，是7月中以來最少。市場原本預期維持於20萬人。</p><p></p><p>持續申領人數按周則增加2.5萬人，至172.8萬，並高過市場預期的171萬人。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:28.318298+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T14:45:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T04:38:00.177897+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:15.318005+00:00","content_hash":"86ac2763d73b1ec32d4985a0ee164b6861e3cbd752f380b0ffefd7686333916c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:28.318298+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}